  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2701.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2701.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish standards for regulating visible emissions, particulate matter emissions, and fugitive emissions from hot mix asphalt plants.\n\nSource. #6428-B, eff 1-18-97 (formerly Env-A 1209); ss by #8217, eff 11-24-04; ss by #10272, eff 2-16-13; ss by #13492, eff 11-19-22",
